            "doc_comment": "/// Return the current UTC time as an ISO-8601 string, e.g. `\"2026-03-28T12:00:00Z\"`.\n\n///\n\n/// Reimplemented inline (same algorithm as `codex-parser::serializer`) to avoid\n\n/// a cross-crate dependency on a trivial utility.\n"
          },
          {
            "name": "unix_secs_to_datetime",
            "kind": "function",
            "visibility": "private",
            "span": {
              "start_line": 201,
